 \label{nondeg}
Let $V$ be a reduced, equidimensional, non-degenerate subvariety of $\ensuremath{\mathbb{P}}^n$ ($n \geq 4$) of codimension 2 (not necessarily irreducible). 
Let $H$ be a general hyperplane and let $W = V \cap H$. Then $W$ is non-degenerate in $H = \ensuremath{\mathbb{P}}^{n-1}$.

